WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.240
You need small paper cups you cannot see through, cotton balls, foil, and rubber

2
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:11.880
bands. For smells, use kitchen foods like orange peel and a cinnamon stick.

3
00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.060
Add two juices that look alike.

4
00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:19.853
Put a cotton ball in each cup, and add one smell to two cups, so every smell has a

5
00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:23.453
pair. An adult covers each cup with foil and pokes the holes.

6
00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:25.093
Label the cups.

7
00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.547
Your child sniffs and matches the pairs.

8
00:00:28.207 --> 00:00:31.287
Later, they pinch their nose, sip juice, then let go.

9
00:00:32.047 --> 00:00:34.767
Most children notice the flavour arrive when the nose opens.

10
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.720
Stay with your child.

11
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.520
Use kitchen foods only.

12
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.140
Check every food for allergies before tasting.
